---
const tools = [
  {
    name: 'Pashov skills',
    href: 'https://github.com/pashov/skills',
    logo: '/logos/audit/pashov.svg',
    description: 'Solidity audit-readiness, threat-model, invariant, and differential-review workflows.',
  },
  {
    name: 'ETHSKILLS',
    href: 'https://ethskills.com',
    logo: '/logos/audit/ethskills.svg',
    description: 'Ethereum guidance for chain semantics, RPC behavior, contract calls, and signing.',
  },
  {
    name: 'Trail of Bits',
    href: 'https://www.trailofbits.com',
    logo: '/logos/audit/trail-of-bits.svg',
    description: 'Slither static analysis, Echidna property fuzzing, and security-review checklists.',
  },
  {
    name: 'Verity Lang',
    href: 'https://veritylang.com',
    logo: '/logos/audit/verity.svg',
    description: 'Lean 4 machine-checked proofs for Ophis access-control models.',
  },
]
---

<section class="audit-methodology" aria-labelledby="audit-methodology-heading">
  <h2 id="audit-methodology-heading">Audit methodology and tools</h2>
  <p>
    Ophis used the following open-source security skills, guidance, analysis tools, and formal-verification
    technology across applicable review scopes.
  </p>
  <div class="tool-grid">
    {tools.map((tool) => (
      <a class="tool-card" href={tool.href}>
        <span class="logo-stage" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src={tool.logo} alt="" width="64" height="56" loading="lazy" />
        </span>
        <span class="tool-copy">
          <strong>{tool.name}</strong>
          <span>{tool.description}</span>
        </span>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>
  <p class="methodology-note">
    These credits describe Ophis's use of tooling and methodology. They do not represent an independent
    audit, engagement, certification, or endorsement by Pashov Audit Group, ETHSKILLS contributors, Trail
    of Bits, or LFG Labs / Verity. Ophis has not yet engaged an external audit firm for the fork-specific
    pieces.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .audit-methodology { margin-top: 52px; }
  .tool-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  .tool-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 72px minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 104px;
    padding: 14px;
    color: var(--ophis-fg-muted);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
    border: 1px solid var(--ophis-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease;
  }
  .tool-card:hover {
    color: var(--ophis-fg-muted);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
    border-color: rgba(242, 166, 62, 0.38);
  }
  .tool-card:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--ophis-saffron-60);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .logo-stage {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    padding: 9px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #09090b;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .logo-stage img {
    display: block;
    max-width: 100%;
    max-height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }
  .tool-copy { min-width: 0; }
  .tool-copy strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    color: var(--ophis-fg);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .tool-copy > span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .methodology-note {
    padding: 16px 18px;
    color: var(--ophis-fg-faded);
    background: rgba(242, 166, 62, 0.045);
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(242, 166, 62, 0.55);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .tool-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
